                "purpose": "Establish assay, treatment, control, build, peak shape and output semantics.",
                "required_logic": [
                    "Inspect treatment and control files, assay, library, replicate, genome build, coordinate system, source digests and peak-shape rationale before execution.",
                    "Require a matched input/control for ChIP-seq; preserve and justify no-control CUT&RUN or CUT&Tag handling.",
